HieraFire builds on YOLOv12 (sunsmarterjie/yolov12) and Ultralytics
(ultralytics/ultralytics). Upstream copyright and AGPL-3.0 notices are retained.
The ultralytics Python namespace is preserved for checkpoint compatibility.
Framework modules may contain support for other architectures; only the final
HieraFire model configuration is distributed in this release.
